{
  "id": "staff-turnover",
  "term": "staff turnover",
  "definition": "Staff turnover is the rate at which staff members start or leave work in an organization over time. In this mental health service context, it refers to changes in clinical staff such as psychiatrists, physicians, and psychologists, and contrasts with staff consistency, meaning longer periods without such changes.",
